% layout 'default';
% title 'Indicatori giornalieri';

<script src="<%=url_for(helperGetFileVersion('/bobo-js/statistiche/indicatori.js'))%>" type="text/javascript"></script>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <!-- Nav tabs -->
        <ul class="nav nav-tabs" role="tablist">
            <li class="nav-item"> <a class="nav-link active" data-toggle="tab" href="#tab-pdf" role="tab">Calcolo indicatori</a></li>
            <li class="nav-item"> <a class="nav-link" data-toggle="tab" href="#tab-prov" role="tab">Provincia/Rete</a></li>
            <li class="nav-item"> <a class="nav-link" data-toggle="tab" href="#tab-staz" role="tab">Stazioni</a></li>
            <li class="nav-item"> <a class="nav-link" data-toggle="tab" href="#tab-sup" role="tab">Limiti riferimento</a></li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Tab panes -->
        <div class="tab-content tabcontent-border tab-big mb-4 img-all-view" id="main-tab">

            <!-- Download PDF -->
            <div class="tab-pane p-20 active" id="tab-pdf" role="tabpanel">
                <h4 class="box-title text-info">Statistiche giornaliere <strong>scaricabili in PDF</strong></h4>
                <hr class="m-t-0 m-b-20">
                <p>Calcola le statistiche selezionando il giorno e la provincia, in seguito scaricale in versione PDF.</p>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-xl-3 col-lg-4 m-b-10 input-group">
                        <input type="text" class="form-control clear-input" id="pdf-daily-date" name="pdf-daily-date" placeholder="mm/dd/yyyy">
                        <div class="input-group-append">
                            <span class="input-group-text"><i class="icon-calender"></i></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-xl-3 col-lg-4 m-b-10">
                        <select class="custom-select col-12" id="networks3" name="networks3">
                            <option value="-1">Seleziona rete...</option>
                            % foreach my $net (@{$networks}){
                                <option value="<%= $net->{'st_network_id'} %>"><%= $net->{'st_network_desc'} %></option>
                            % }
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-xl-3 col-lg-4 m-b-10">
                        <select class="custom-select col-12" id="provinces3" name="provinces3">
                            <option value="-1">Seleziona provincia...</option>
                            % $region = '';
                            % foreach my $province (@{$provinces}){
                                % if ($region eq ''){
                                    <optgroup label="<%= $province->{'region_name'} %>">
                                    <option value="<%= $province->{'province_id'} %>"><%= $province->{'province_name'} %></option>
                                % }else{
                                    % if ($region eq $province->{'region_id'}){
                                        <option value="<%= $province->{'province_id'} %>"><%= $province->{'province_name'} %></option>
                                    % } else {
                                        </optgroup>
                                        <optgroup label="<%= $province->{'region_name'} %>">
                                        <option value="<%= $province->{'province_id'} %>"><%= $province->{'province_name'} %></option>
                                    % }
                                % }
                                % $region = $province->{'region_id'};
                            % }
                            </optgroup>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-xl-3 col-lg-4 m-b-10 stat-buttons">
                        <button type="button" id="stats-calc" class="btn btn-rounded btn-info">Calcola STAT.</button>
                        <button type="button" id="stats-pdf" class="btn btn-rounded btn-danger">Genera PDF</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <table id="pdf-download-table" class="display responsive table table-hover table-striped tbl-va-center" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Data report</th>
                            <th>Ultima modifica</th>
                            <th>Nome report</th>
                            <th>Download</th>
                            <th></th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                    </tbody>
                    <tfoot>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Data report</th>
                            <th>Ultima modifica</th>
                            <th>Nome report</th>
                            <th>Download</th>
                            <th></th>
                        </tr>
                    </tfoot>
                </table>
            </div>

            <!-- Provincia/Rete -->
            <div class="tab-pane p-20" id="tab-prov" role="tabpanel">
                <h4 class="box-title text-info">Statistiche giornaliere suddivise per <strong>provincia o rete</strong></h4>
                <hr class="m-t-0 m-b-20">
                <p>Visualizza le statistiche giornaliere selezionando una data dal calendario e filtrando per provincia o rete</p>
                <div class="row m-b-10">
                    <div class="col-md-4 input-group">
                        <input type="text" class="form-control clear-input" id="report-daily-date" name="report-daily-date" placeholder="mm/dd/yyyy">
                        <div class="input-group-append">
                            <span class="input-group-text"><i class="icon-calender"></i></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <select class="custom-select col-12" id="networks" name="networks">
                            <option value="-1">Seleziona rete...</option>
                            % foreach my $net (@{$networks}){
                                <option value="<%= $net->{'st_network_id'} %>"><%= $net->{'st_network_desc'} %></option>
                            % }
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <select class="custom-select col-12" id="provinces" name="provinces" >
                            <option value="-1">Seleziona provincia...</option>
                            % $region = '';
                            % foreach my $province (@{$provinces}){

                                % if ($region eq ''){
                                    <optgroup label="<%= $province->{'region_name'} %>">
                                    <option value="<%= $province->{'province_id'} %>"><%= $province->{'province_name'} %></option>
                                % }else{
                                    % if ($region eq $province->{'region_id'}){
                                        <option value="<%= $province->{'province_id'} %>"><%= $province->{'province_name'} %></option>
                                    % } else {
                                        </optgroup>
                                        <optgroup label="<%= $province->{'region_name'} %>">
                                        <option value="<%= $province->{'province_id'} %>"><%= $province->{'province_name'} %></option>
                                    % }
                                % }
                                % $region = $province->{'region_id'};
                            % }
                            </optgroup>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div id="tab-period-data">
                    <h5 class="subtitle-tabbing">Hai selezionato: <strong></strong></h5>
                    <div class="table-scroll tbl-scroll-modal m-t-5">
                        <table id="dynamic-daily-table" cellspacing="0" >
                            <thead>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody class="text-center">
                            </tbody>
                            <tfoot>
                            </tfoot>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Stazioni -->
            <div class="tab-pane p-20" id="tab-staz" role="tabpanel">
                <h4 class="box-title text-info">Statistiche giornaliere suddivise per <strong>stazioni</strong></h4>
                <hr class="m-t-0 m-b-20">
                <p>Visualizza le statistiche giornaliere per una data stazione selezionando il periodo interessato</p>
                <div class="row m-b-10">
                    <div class="input-group col-md-3">
                        <input class="form-control input-daterange-datepicker" type="text" name="daterange" value="" />
                        <div class="input-group-append">
                            <span class="input-group-text"><i class="mdi mdi-calendar-multiple"></i></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-3">
                        <select class="custom-select col-12" id="networks2" name="networks2">
                            <option value="-1">Seleziona rete...</option>
                            % foreach my $net (@{$networks}){
                                <option value="<%= $net->{'st_network_id'} %>"><%= $net->{'st_network_desc'} %></option>
                            % }
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-3">
                        <select class="custom-select col-12" id="provinces2" name="provinces2" data-change="stations">
                            <option value="-1">Seleziona provincia...</option>
                            % $region = '';
                            % foreach my $province (@{$provinces}){

                                % if ($region eq ''){
                                    <optgroup label="<%= $province->{'region_name'} %>">
                                    <option value="<%= $province->{'province_id'} %>"><%= $province->{'province_name'} %></option>
                                % }else{
                                    % if ($region eq $province->{'region_id'}){
                                        <option value="<%= $province->{'province_id'} %>"><%= $province->{'province_name'} %></option>
                                    % } else {
                                        </optgroup>
                                        <optgroup label="<%= $province->{'region_name'} %>">
                                        <option value="<%= $province->{'province_id'} %>"><%= $province->{'province_name'} %></option>
                                    % }
                                % }
                                % $region = $province->{'region_id'};
                            % }
                            </optgroup>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-3">
                        <select class="custom-select col-12" id="stations" name="stations">
                            <option value="-1">Seleziona stazione...</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div id="tab-staz-data">
                    <h5 class="subtitle-tabbing">Hai selezionato: <strong></strong></h5>
                    <div class="table-scroll tbl-scroll-modal m-t-5">
                        <table id="dynamic-staz-table" cellspacing="0" >
                            <thead>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody class="text-center">
                            </tbody>
                            <tfoot>
                            </tfoot>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Superamenti -->
            <div class="tab-pane p-20" id="tab-sup" role="tabpanel">
                <h4 class="box-title text-info">Limiti di riferimento <strong>suddivisi per inquinante</strong></h4>
                <hr class="m-t-0 m-b-20">
                <p>Per ogni inquinante vengono inseriti i limiti di riferimento con i massimi superamenti annuali previsti.</p>

                <table class="display responsive table tbl-va-center" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Inquinante</th>
                            <th>Limite</th>
                            <th>Periodo di mediazione</th>
                            <th>Limite</th>
                            <th>Superamenti in un anno</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <!-- ************ PM10 ************* -->
                        <tr>
                            <td rowspan="2" style=" vertical-align: middle;">
                                <strong class="text-info">PM10</strong> (µg/m<sup>3</sup>)
                            </td>
                            <td>Valore limite sulle 24 ore per la protezione della salute umana</td>
                            <td>Media giornaliera</td>
                            <td>50 µg/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td>massimo 35</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Valore limite annuale per la protezione della salute umana</td>
                            <td>anno civile</td>
                            <td>40 µg/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td></td>
                        </tr><!-- ************ PM2.5 ************* -->
                        <tr>
                            <td>
                                <strong class="text-info">PM2.5</strong> (µg/m<sup>3</sup>)
                            </td>
                            <td>Valore Limite annuale per la protezione della salute umana</td>
                            <td>anno civile</td>
                            <td>25 µg/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td></td>
                        </tr><!-- ************ NO2 ************* -->
                        <tr>
                            <td rowspan="2" style=" vertical-align: middle;">
                                <strong class="text-info">NO<sub>2</sub></strong> (µg/m<sup>3</sup>)
                            </td>
                            <td>Valore limite orario per la protezione della salute umana</td>
                            <td>Media massima oraria</td>
                            <td>200 µg/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td>massimo 18</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Valore limite annuale per la protezione della salute umana</td>
                            <td>anno civile</td>
                            <td>40 µg/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td></td>
                        </tr><!-- ************ OZONO ************* -->
                        <tr>
                            <td rowspan="4" style=" vertical-align: middle;">
                                <strong class="text-info">O<sub>3</sub></strong> (µg/m<sup>3</sup>)
                            </td>
                            <td>Soglia d'informazione</td>
                            <td>Media massima oraria</td>
                            <td>180 µg/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Soglia d'allarme</td>
                            <td>Media massima oraria</td>
                            <td>240 µg/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Valore obiettivo</td>
                            <td>Media massima giornaliera calcolata su 8 ore</td>
                            <td>120 µg/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td>&lt;= 25 volte/anno come media su 3 anni</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Valore obiettivo per laprotezione della vegetazione</td>
                            <td>AOT40, calcolato sulla base dei valori di 1 ora da maggio a luglio</td>
                            <td>18000 µg/m<sup>3</sup> come media su 5 anni</td>
                            <td></td>
                        </tr><!-- ************ CO ************* -->
                        <tr>
                            <td>
                                <strong class="text-info">CO</strong> (mg/m<sup>3</sup>)
                            </td>
                            <td>Valore limite orario per la protezione della salute umana</td>
                            <td>Media massima giornaliera calcolata su 8 ore</td>
                            <td>10 mg/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td></td>
                        </tr><!-- ************ SO2 ************* -->
                        <tr>
                            <td rowspan="2" style=" vertical-align: middle;">
                                <strong class="text-info">SO<sub>2</sub></strong> (µg/m<sup>3</sup>)
                            </td>
                            <td>Valore limite giornaliero</td>
                            <td>Media giornaliera</td>
                            <td>125 µg/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td>massimo 3</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Valore limite su 1 ora per la protezione della salute umana</td>
                            <td>Media massima oraria</td>
                            <td>350 µg/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td>massimo 24</td>
                        </tr><!-- ************ BENZENE ************* -->
                        <tr>
                            <td>
                                <strong class="text-info">Benzene</strong> (µg/m<sup>3</sup>)
                            </td>
                            <td>Valore limite su base annua</td>
                            <td>anno civile</td>
                            <td>5 µg/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td></td>
                        </tr><!-- ************ Benzo(a)pirene  ************* -->
                        <tr>
                            <td>
                                <strong class="text-info">Benzo(a)pirene</strong> (ng/m<sup>3</sup>)
                            </td>
                            <td>Concentrazione presente nella frazione PM10 del materiale particolato, calcolato come media su un anno civile</td>
                            <td>anno civile</td>
                            <td>1 ng/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td></td>
                        </tr><!-- ************ Metalli As, Cd, Ni   ************* -->
                        <tr>
                            <td rowspan="4" style=" vertical-align: middle;">
                                <strong class="text-info">Metalli pesanti</strong> (ng/m<sup>3</sup>)
                            </td>
                            <td>Arsenico</td>
                            <td>anno civile</td>
                            <td>6 ng/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Cadmio</td>
                            <td>anno civile</td>
                            <td>5 ng/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Nichel</td>
                            <td>anno civile</td>
                            <td>20 ng/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Piombo</td>
                            <td>anno civile</td>
                            <td>0,5 µg/m<sup>3</sup></td>
                            <td></td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                    <tfoot>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Inquinante</th>
                            <th>Limite</th>
                            <th>Periodo di mediazione</th>
                            <th>Limite</th>
                            <th>Superamenti in un anno</th>
                        </tr>
                    </tfoot>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>